<p>Hello <%= @user.display_name %>,</p>

<p>Enter this code on the WISP sign-in page:</p>

<p style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 6px; font-family: monospace;"><%= @code %></p>

<p>Or, on the device where you read this email, use this link:</p>

<p><%= email_link_to "Sign in to WISP", @url %></p>

<p>Each can be used once, and both expire in <%= @ttl_minutes %> minutes.</p>

<p>If you didn't ask to sign in, you can safely ignore this email. No one can sign in without the code or the link.</p>
